  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Legendary_Dumpster_Fire\">The Legendary Dumpster Fire</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item currently cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a> and probably should be able to be.</i></span></span>\n</p>\n<table style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #B1D3A0 solid; margin: 4px; --bg-color-1:#CCFF99;--bg-color-1-dark:#3D5F1A;--bg-color-2:var(--background-color-disabled-subtle, #D3D3D3);\" width=\"100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Minimum Level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">29\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"13\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"width: 425px; background-color: #D3D3D3;\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/File:Trash_Shot_icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Trash_Shot_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><br /><a href=\"/page/Trash_Shot\" title=\"Trash Shot\">Trash Shot</a>\n<table class=\"fakeClass\" style=\"width: 420px; font-weight: normal; text-align: left;\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Target:</th><td>Foe, Directional, Breakable</td></tr>\n<tr><th>School:</th><td>Evocation</td></tr><tr><th>Spell Resistance:</th><td>No</td></tr>\n<tr><th>Description:</th><td>Fires a slow moving pile of burning trash.  Opponents in the blast radius take bludgeoning, fire, poison, and rust damage.  Opponents stuck by this receive a Fortitude save for half damage.  When fully charged, this fires two projectiles that fly much faster.</td></tr>\n<tr><th colspan=\"2\">&#160;</th></tr>\n<tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier I:</th><td>4 to 10 &#8203; + 1 to 2 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier II:</th><td>5 to 15 &#8203; + 1 to 4 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier III:</th><td>6 to 20 &#8203; + 1 to 6 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier IV:</th><td>7 to 25 &#8203; + 1 to 8 per Artificer Level</td></tr><tr><th style=\"width: 100px;\">Charge Tier V:</th><td>8 to 30 &#8203; + 1 to 10 per Artificer Level</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Required Trait\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Use\" title=\"Rune Arm Use\">Artificer Rune Arm Use</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\"><a href=\"/page/Use_Magical_Device\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Use Magical Device\">Use Magical Device</a> <a href=\"/page/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Account&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">475 / 475\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Made from\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Rust\" title=\"Rust\">Rust</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Rust\" title=\"Rust\">Rust</a>:</b> <b>Rust</b> items have been neglected for so long that the steel they were originally made from has almost entirely rusted. The hardness and durability of these items is often low.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">39\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0011600100</span>11,600<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;1<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">gp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Gold Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">0.25 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Scavenger_Hunt\" title=\"Scavenger Hunt\">Scavenger Hunt</a></b>, End Chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Maximum_Charge_Tier\" title=\"Maximum Charge Tier\">Maximum Charge Tier</a>: V</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Trash_Shot\" title=\"Trash Shot\">Trash Shot</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Combustion\" title=\"Combustion\">Combustion +142</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Combustion\" title=\"Combustion\">Combustion +142</a>:</b> Passive: +142 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Fire <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Fire Lore +21%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Fire Lore +21</a>:</b> Passive: Your Fire spells gain a 21% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Shield_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shield Bonus\">Shield +13</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Shield_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shield Bonus\">Shield +13</a>:</b> While this item is equipped, you are partially protected by a field of magical force which can deflect enemy attacks. This item provides a +13 Shield bonus to Armor Class. It does not stack with an equipped shield.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.purple>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Purple\"]{background-color:#DDA0DD;border-color:#225F22}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.green>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Green\"]{background-color:#90EE90;border-color:#6F116F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.yellow>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Yellow\"]{background-color:#EEE8AA;border-color:#111755}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.blue>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Blue\"]{background-color:#87CEFA;border-color:#783105}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.red>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Red\"]{background-color:#FA8072;border-color:#057F8D}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.colorless>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Colorless\"]{background-color:#F8F8FF;border-color:#070700}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.sun>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Sun\"]{background-color:#FFFFC0;border-color:#00003F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.moon>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Moon\"]{background-color:#C0FFFF;border-color:#3F0000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a{border:1px solid;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 3px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a{color:#003366}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a:visited{color:#040050}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.tooltip::after{content:\" augments.\"}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment green\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Green Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Blue_augments\" title=\"Category:Blue augments\">Blue</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Green_augments\" title=\"Category:Green augments\">Green</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Yellow_augments\" title=\"Category:Yellow augments\">Yellow</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span> and/or <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Shield Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Shield Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Imbue\" title=\"Rune Arm Imbue\">Rune Arm Imbue</a>: Bludgeon V, Fire V<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Imbue\" title=\"Rune Arm Imbue\">Rune Arm Imbue</a>: Bludgeon V, Fire V: Wearing this Rune Arm will imbue any weapon you wield, dealing 2d8, 2d10 points of Bludgeon, Fire damage per hit.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p>Not upgradeable \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p><i>Do you want ants?  This is how you get ants.</i>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p>Trash Shot:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Deals bludgeoning, fire, poison, and rust damage to single target.</li>\n<li>Shots flies slowly and straightly.</li>\n<li>Basically shots homing to target. If you fire a shot which charged while moving, then those shots won't home in horizontally but will home in vertically. Shots which charged while standing will home in correctly even if you fire that while moving.</li>\n<li>Fires 1:1:2:2:3 shots for each charge tier.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:The_Legendary_Dumpster_Fire_Shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/The_Legendary_Dumpster_Fire_Shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"336\" height=\"326\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:The_Legendary_Dumpster_Fire.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/The_Legendary_Dumpster_Fire.png/420px-The_Legendary_Dumpster_Fire.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"701\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/The_Legendary_Dumpster_Fire.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817231450\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.104 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.128 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5850/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 43828/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12491/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 20/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  107.528      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  107.528      1 -total\n 96.67%  103.952      1 Template:Named_Rune_Arm\n 66.74%   71.762     63 Template:IO\n 22.68%   24.392     10 Template:Popup\n 21.01%   22.595      1 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 20.31%   21.834      1 Template:IsLamannia\n 19.70%   21.185      1 Template:IsSpeculation\n 19.05%   20.486      1 Template:InCategory\n 15.31%   16.463      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:74378-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817231450 and revision id 635373. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Rune Arm\n  | name                     = The Legendary Dumpster Fire\n  | reqtrait                 = [[Rune Arm Use|Artificer Rune Arm Use]]\n  | UMD DC                   = \n  | minlevel                 = 29\n  | durability               = 475\n  | material                 = Rust\n  | hardness                 = 39\n  | released                 = Update 42\n  | quest                    = Scavenger Hunt\n  | chest                    = End Chest\n  | end reward               = \n  | turn in                  = \n  | cost                     = 11600 pp 1gp\n  | weight                   = 0.25 lbs\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtA|BoA}}\n  | spell                    = Trash Shot\n  | target                   = Foe, Directional, Breakable \n  | school                   = Evocation\n  | sr                       = No\n  | spell desc               = Fires a slow moving pile of burning trash.  Opponents in the blast radius take bludgeoning, fire, poison, and rust damage.  Opponents stuck by this receive a Fortitude save for half damage.  When fully charged, this fires two projectiles that fly much faster.\n  | max charge               = 5\n  | imbue                    = Bludgeon V, Fire V\n  | imbue die                = 2d8, 2d10\n  | imbue dmg                = Bludgeon, Fire\n  | enhancements             = \n* [[Trash Shot]]\n* {{SpellPower|Combustion|142}}\n* {{Spelllore|Fire|21}}\n* {{Shield Bonus|13}}\n* {{Augment|green}}\n  | craftable rune arm       = no\n  | epic                     = <!-- no -->\n  | crafting                 = \n  | craftingupgrade          = <!--What item can be upgraded to-->\n  | craftingnotes            = <!--Any notes about the craftable item-->\n  | pic                      = Trash Shot icon.png\n  | picdesc                  = The Legendary Dumpster Fire.png\n  | description              = Do you want ants?  This is how you get ants.\n  | tips                     = \nTrash Shot:\n* Deals bludgeoning, fire, poison, and rust damage to single target.\n* Shots flies slowly and straightly.\n* Basically shots homing to target. If you fire a shot which charged while moving, then those shots won't home in horizontally but will home in vertically. Shots which charged while standing will home in correctly even if you fire that while moving.\n* Fires 1:1:2:2:3 shots for each charge tier.\n[[Image:The Legendary Dumpster Fire Shown.jpg]]\n}}",
